---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Panel from '../components/Panel.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — learninghub"
  description="Why learninghub exists and how these deep-dives are written."
>
  <section class="about wrap">
    <span class="tag">About</span>
    <h1>Learning in public, one system at a time.</h1>

    <p class="intro">
      Every article here starts as a personal study log: a syllabus, a set of
      pass/fail checks, and a running list of the things I got <em>wrong</em> and
      had to relearn. When a topic clicks, I rewrite those notes as a deep-dive
      meant for someone standing where I was a few weeks ago.
    </p>

    <Panel title="How each deep-dive is built" meta="method" padded={false}>
      <table class="meta-table">
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th>model</th>
            <td>Mental model first — before any API, the one idea that makes the rest make sense.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>rubric</th>
            <td>Each section maps to a concrete "can you actually do this?" check, not just exposure.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>gotchas</th>
            <td>The <span class="tag inline-tag">⚠ Gotcha</span> boxes are real mistakes from my review queue — misconceptions that cost me a session to unlearn, so they cost you a minute.</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>verified</th>
            <td>Version-specific facts are checked against current docs before publishing.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </Panel>

    <p class="outro">
      The goal isn't a reference you skim — it's understanding you keep. If a
      section can't survive being explained back in your own words, it isn't done.
    </p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .about { max-width: 44rem; padding-top: 2.8rem; }
    .about h1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 2.8rem); margin: 1rem 0 1.4rem; }
    .intro, .outro { font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-soft); }
    .intro { margin: 0 0 2rem; }
    .outro { margin: 2rem 0 0; }
    .about em { color: var(--accent-ink); font-style: italic; }
    .inline-tag { text-transform: none; }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
